# Porting Premium Features to MFE-2 (FSD)

This plan outlines the migration of high-fidelity features and "Neon-Dark" aesthetics from the `MFE` branch into the `MFE-2` branch, while strictly adhering to the **Feature-Sliced Design (FSD)** architecture.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Merging these changes requires significant manual refactoring to fit the "flat" logic of `MFE` into the "sliced" architecture of `MFE-2`.
> The "Experimental / Neon-Dark" aesthetic will replace the "Standard / Professional-Clean" look currently in `MFE-2`.

